The legal texts are Korean statutes as published by the National Law Information Center (국가법령정보센터,
https://www.law.go.kr), Ministry of Government Legislation (법제처), through its Open API, retrieved 28 October 2026.

Statutes are not protected by copyright in Korea: 저작권법 제7조 (Copyright Act, Article 7) excludes from protection
the Constitution, statutes, treaties, orders, ordinances and rules (헌법ㆍ법률ㆍ조약ㆍ명령ㆍ조례 및 규칙).

Changes made by Lexifina: each version was converted to one Markdown file per article; editorial notes and
amendment tags were removed; spacing and quotation marks were normalised. The wording of the law was not changed.
The Government of Korea does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages and the tools) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
